## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100
## Title: |cff0091edNaowh|r Smart Reminders Chinese Localization Pack
## Title-zhCN: |cff0091edNaowh|r Smart Reminders 中文汉化包
## Title-zhTW: |cff0091edNaowh|r Smart Reminders 中文漢化包
## Notes: Requires Naowh Smart Reminders. Install it first, then install this pack. Simplified and Traditional Chinese are both included, and the right one is picked automatically from your client language.
## Notes-zhCN: 需要先安装 Naowh Smart Reminders，再安装本汉化包。同时提供简体中文与繁体中文，按客户端语系自动选用。
## Notes-zhTW: 需要先安裝 Naowh Smart Reminders，再安裝本漢化包。同時提供簡體中文與繁體中文，依客戶端語系自動選用。
## Author: @project-author@
